    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "probe match (1 = the deployed cert is what is served)",
      "description": "Mirrors alert WecertServedCertificateIsNotTheDeployedOne (critical). 0 = the endpoint is not serving a usable copy: rebind not effective / another cert winning SNI / chain fails verification. Read alongside probe errors to tell environment problems apart.",
